<span id="Description"></span>
==Описание==

The '''Std Refresh''' command recomputes selected objects ({{Version|26.3}}), or the active document if no objects are selected. The command is disabled if no recompute is required, but in that case the command can still be invoked through its shortcut.

<span id="Usage"></span>
==Применение==

# There are several ways to invoke the command:
#* Press the {{Button|[[Image:Std_Refresh.svg|16px]] [[Std_Refresh|Recompute]]}} button.
#* Select the {{MenuCommand|Edit → [[Image:Std_Refresh.svg|16px]] Recompute}} option from the menu.
#* Use the keyboard shortcut: {{KEY|Ctrl}}+{{KEY|Shift}}+{{KEY|R}}.

<span id="Options"></span>
==Опции==

* If no recompute is required and the command is disabled, a recompute can be forced:
*# Do one of the following:
*#* Select one or more individual objects in the [[Tree_View|Tree View]].
*#* Select the document in the Tree View to include all objects.
*# Select the {{MenuCommand|[[Image:Std_MarkToRecompute.svg|16px]] Mark to Recompute}} option from the context menu.
*# Invoke the now enabled command as described above.
* Alternatively, to recompute individual objects:
*# Select one or more individual objects in the Tree View.
*# Select the {{MenuCommand|[[Image:Std_Refresh.svg|16px]] Recompute Object}} from the context menu.

<span id="Notes"></span>
==Примечания==

* For a macro that will recompute the active document see: [[Macro_ForceRecompute|Macro ForceRecompute]].

<span id="Scripting"></span>
==Программирование==

<div class="mw-translate-fuzzy">
{{Emphasis|Смотрите так же:}} [[FreeCAD_Scripting_Basics/ru|Основы составления скриптов в FreeCAD]].
</div>

<div class="mw-translate-fuzzy">
Для обновления документа используйте метод {{incode|recompute}} объекта document.
</div>

{{Code|code=
import FreeCAD

doc = FreeCAD.ActiveDocument
doc.recompute()
}}

The same method is available for objects in the document:

{{Code|code=
import FreeCAD

doc = FreeCAD.ActiveDocument
for obj in doc.Objects[0:3]:
    obj.recompute()
}}

To mark an object for recomputation use the {{incode|touch}} method of the object. The code below corresponds to forcing a recompute by selecting the document as explained in [[#Options|Options]]:

{{Code|code=
import FreeCAD

doc = FreeCAD.ActiveDocument
for obj in doc.Objects:
    obj.touch()
doc.recompute()
}}


